          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋapaarasya ŋatomoniomwon ka ŋakuwarisya ŋatomoniomwon ŋuna aperyo ayoŋ alokwap adyekit Ekapolon aŋuna kus, anerae aris iŋes ketubu amunyar iyes, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abu ayoŋ elip Ekapolon otema, “Ekapolon Akuj, nyimunya kareca ŋituŋa ŋulu erae ŋulu kon ŋulu, ibu iyoŋ tolaku a apolou kon, ŋulu ibu iyoŋ yau alo Ijipit a apedor kon a ŋina etiron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Totamu ŋiketiyak kon Aburaam, Isaka ka Yakob, nyimitak agogoŋu a ŋakyes a ŋituŋa a lu, nyimitak aronis kec ka asecit kec, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anerae acepaki etemarete ŋituŋa a akwap a ŋina ikiyaunia iyoŋ isua ebe, ‘Aŋuna pa apedorya Ekapolon akiya ikes nakwap ŋina sek eikinit ikes ka aŋuna emanitor iŋes ikes, ayau iŋes ikes, ikotere eari ikes analoŋisat.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erae ikes ŋituŋa ŋulu kon a elope ŋulu ibu iyoŋ iyau ka apedor kon a ŋina apolon ka agogoŋu kon.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.29"
            ]
          }
